		{"id":"bc1ae7a55c9a9369","type":"text","text":"batch 全部数据 /随机梯度下降","x":-140,"y":-840,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7b9e21b2d88b74d9","type":"text","text":"batch 最大化利用向量化的优势，提升速度","x":-140,"y":-529,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ad6926706a05cdf5","type":"text","text":"只用一个样本，有助于我们克服鞍点的问题","x":-140,"y":-640,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d61e3a303ab29ca8","type":"text","text":"Epoch , Batch-Size , Iterations","x":-456,"y":400,"width":294,"height":60},
		{"id":"63549f4b84cbbea5","type":"text","text":"```\n#Training cycle\nfor epoch in range(training_epochs):\n\t#Loop over all batches\n\tfor i in range(total_batches):\n```","x":400,"y":353,"width":440,"height":154},
		{"id":"4393f7767b080b44","type":"text","text":"Definition:Batch_Size\nThe number of training examples in one forward backward pass","x":466,"y":600,"width":309,"height":124},
		{"id":"56a83b8c7407ed82","type":"text","text":"Definition:Iteration\nNumber of passes,each pass using [batch_size]number of examples","x":1000,"y":600,"width":346,"height":124},
		{"id":"e9ee836be424675a","type":"text","text":"Definition:Epoch\nOne forward pass and one backward pass of all the training examples","x":1000,"y":374,"width":346,"height":113},
		{"id":"f84bec61e0f9cdd6","type":"text","text":"Dataloader: batch_size = 2 , shuffle = Ture","x":-456,"y":880,"width":294,"height":80},
		{"id":"21dc44e220691be1","type":"text","text":"shuffle :随机打乱顺序","x":-15,"y":890,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"33ffdf1bcc832a09","type":"file","file":"基于pytorch的深度学习/pythorch photos/dataloader.png","x":420,"y":826,"width":399,"height":188},
		{"id":"f8f5c8a8ecefc38b","type":"text","text":"```\nimport torch\nfrom torch.utils.data import Dataset\nfrom torch.utils.data import DataLoader\n\nclass DiabetesDataset(Dataset):\n\tdef__init__(self):\n\t\tpass\n\t\n\tdef__getitem__(self,index):\n\t\tpass\n\t\t\n\tdef__len__(self):\n\t\tpass\n\ndataset = DiabetesDataset()\ntrain_loader = DataLoader(dataset = dataset,batch_size = 32,shuffle=True,num_wokers=2)\n\n\nif_name_=='_main_':\n\tfor epoch in range(100):\n\t\tfor i , data in enumcrate(train_loader,0):\n```","x":60,"y":1140,"width":940,"height":510},
		{"id":"536b13a6b87557ad","type":"text","text":"Dataset is an abstract class. We can define our class inherited from this class 抽象类不可实例化","x":1032,"y":1140,"width":314,"height":108},
		{"id":"cfba4e938505e1c2","type":"text","text":"DataLoader is a class to help us loading data in Pytorch","x":1032,"y":1262,"width":314,"height":92},
		{"id":"b17e3563b15f98c0","type":"text","text":"the expression,dataset[index],will call this magic function","x":1032,"y":1380,"width":314,"height":98},
		{"id":"6ba01a8fae9d87a9","type":"text","text":"this magic function returns length of dataset","x":1032,"y":1515,"width":314,"height":80},
		{"id":"962f8e70e72d3fc7","type":"text","text":"1,all data in ram","x":1460,"y":1140,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"79e65dfb5e2aa69b","type":"text","text":"2.using list to restore index","x":1460,"y":1262,"width":269,"height":50},
		{"id":"1358918216408272","type":"text","text":"initialiaze loader with batch_size , shuffle , process number.","x":1032,"y":1620,"width":314,"height":60},
		{"id":"cb9229c94d475c47","type":"text","text":"Diabetes Dataset","x":-434,"y":1760,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"3f532c6214d7b420","type":"text","text":"```\nclass DiabetesDataset(Dataset):\n\tdef__init__(self,filepath):\n\t\txy = np.loadtxt(filepath,delimiter=',',dtype = np.float32)\n\t\tself.len = xy.shape[0]\n\t\tself.x_data = torch.from_numpy(xy[:,:,-1])\n\t\tself.y_data = torch.from_numpy(xy[:,[-1]])\n\t\t\n\tdef__getitem__(self,index):\n\t\treturn self.x_data[index],self.y_data[index]\n\t\t\n\tdef__len__(self):\n\t\treturn self.len\n\t\t\ndataset = DiabetesDataset('diabetas.csv.gz')\ntrain_loader = DataLoader(dataset = dataset,batch_size=32,shuffle=Ture,num_wokers=2)\n```","x":60,"y":1760,"width":744,"height":440},
		{"id":"edb9cefaae76a114","type":"text","text":"```\nfor epoch in range(100):\n\tfor i,data in enumcrate(train_loader,0):\n\t\t#1.prepare data\n\t\tinputs,labels = data\n\t\t#2.forward\n\t\ty_pred = model(inputs)\n\t\tloss = criterion(y_pred,labels)\n\t\tprint(epoch,i,loss.item())\n\t\t#3.backward\n\t\toptimizer.zero_grad()\n\t\tloss.backward()\n\t\toptimizer.step()\n```","x":1032,"y":1818,"width":623,"height":323},
